>But be warned, every jump, every move, counts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss your timing, and you might find yourself backed into a corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/2ff06ba1e3f2a36da1d5b384e87236fa.poster.avif?t=1777530573\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/2ff06ba1e3f2a36da1d5b384e87236fa.webm?t=1777530573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/2ff06ba1e3f2a36da1d5b384e87236fa.mp4?t=1777530573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/0398537dc429fb7431226304c557983e.avif?t=1777530573\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras_big/0398537dc429fb7431226304c557983e.avif?t=1777530573 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself through 9 themed areas with 45 increasingly tricky stages.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against mysterious foes, unravel strange disturbances, and master your rhythm and tactics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who think fast and move faster will uncover what lies beyond...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/83b80e5ba1267ddb4c282d96ff51a323.poster.avif?t=1777530573\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/83b80e5ba1267ddb4c282d96ff51a323.webm?t=1777530573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/83b80e5ba1267ddb4c282d96ff51a323.mp4?t=1777530573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/f330d24cfb855639fe1b8936ab30990e.avif?t=1777530573\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras_big/f330d24cfb855639fe1b8936ab30990e.avif?t=1777530573 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into fierce PvP battles with up to 4 players!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and battle across 100+ intense stages, each with its own layout and traps.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No character stats, no unfair edge, just skill, strategy, and the thrill of the bounce!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/be67967d7e10aa9dcb7e349b6376f6a0.poster.avif?t=1777530573\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/be67967d7e10aa9dcb7e349b6376f6a0.webm?t=1777530573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/be67967d7e10aa9dcb7e349b6376f6a0.mp4?t=1777530573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
